    "detailed_description": "<strong>THE PREMISE</strong><br>Chris Isn't Alone is a horror/comedy game where your choices actually have an effect on the outcome of the story.  <br>You play as Chris, a 12 year old boy that has just come to the realization that the monster in his closet was real. <br>The monster informs you that they are there to kill you. <br><i>You must convince it otherwise. </i><br><br><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong><br>You will be presented with many different choices that WILL have an effect on the outcome of the story. <br>A story path that you may have gone down previously could end up changing depending on what items Chris has...<br><br><strong>ENDINGS</strong><br>There are a total of 17 unique endings! <br>Can you find the TRUE ending?<br>There is a reward for unlocking all the endings...<br><br><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong><br>When you see text on the screen, you can Left Click to advance through the dialogue. <br>Players can use a mouse or trackpad.<br><br><strong>PLEASE ENJOY!</strong><br>Keep in mind that this is a student project! <br>Feedback would be amazing!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>THE PREMISE</strong><br>Chris Isn't Alone is a horror/comedy game where your choices actually have an effect on the outcome of the story.  <br>You play as Chris, a 12 year old boy that has just come to the realization that the monster in his closet was real. <br>The monster informs you that they are there to kill you. <br><i>You must convince it otherwise. </i><br><br><strong>CHOOSE YOUR OWN PATH</strong><br>You will be presented with many different choices that WILL have an effect on the outcome of the story. <br>A story path that you may have gone down previously could end up changing depending on what items Chris has...<br><br><strong>ENDINGS</strong><br>There are a total of 17 unique endings! <br>Can you find the TRUE ending?<br>There is a reward for unlocking all the endings...<br><br><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong><br>When you see text on the screen, you can Left Click to advance through the dialogue. <br>Players can use a mouse or trackpad.<br><br><strong>PLEASE ENJOY!</strong><br>Keep in mind that this is a student project! <br>Feedback would be amazing!",
    "short_description": "Can you convince a demon from another realm to spare your life? Chris Isn't Alone is a visual novel horror/comedy game that gives players freedom to choose their own path towards their fate. This is a student project!",
